        "structural_geologist_note": "Review the deleted dots as a map: they are the ones whose 300 m explainable-credit was already held by a neighbouring dot. If a deleted dot sits on an unmapped strand rather than in the shadow of a mapped one, that deletion is geologically wrong and the ladder's negative result would be the correct outcome."
